From: shota <monyuonyu@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 13:43:45 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 422/423] Command line: --export-plates, full-size cutting
 drawings of the flat plates

A plate is a solid with two large flat faces facing away from each other,
as far apart as it is thick and thin beside its other sizes. Its larger
face is laid flat (the longest straight edge along x) and written as DXF
(lines, arcs, circles in mm) and as SVG at 1:1 with its name, thickness
and size, and plates.json lists them all.

